export const guideMarkup="<main id=\"shift-food-guide\"><div id=\"top\"></div><nav class=\"nav\" aria-label=\"Guide sections\"><a href=\"#start\">Your start</a><a href=\"#food\">Food</a><a href=\"#shopping\">Shopping list</a><a href=\"#next\">Next step</a></nav>\n    <section class=\"hero wrap\">\n      <div><p class=\"eyebrow\">GRUB · THE SHIFT FOOD GUIDE</p><h1>GOOD FOOD.<br><span class=\"olive\">REAL LIFE.</span></h1><p class=\"hero-text\">Make the food you do eat work harder for you. Familiar meals. Useful swaps. One thing to try this week.</p><a href=\"#start\" class=\"button primary\">Find your starting point <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><p class=\"micro\">A few taps. No diet score. No shopping basket.</p></div>\n      <aside class=\"hero-card\"><span class=\"index-no\">01 / THE RULE OF THUMB</span><div class=\"plate-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"plate-inner\"><span>FOOD<br>FIRST.</span></div><span class=\"plate-dot dot-one\"></span><span class=\"plate-dot dot-two\"></span><span class=\"plate-dot dot-three\"></span></div><h2>Start with a meal you’ll actually eat.</h2><p>You don’t need a whole new routine. Pick something that fits your appetite, your cupboard and your day.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"#evidence\">The guidance behind the ideas <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></aside>\n    </section>\n    <div class=\"principle-strip\"><span>FOOD FIRST</span><span>EVIDENCE IN PLAIN ENGLISH</span><span>USE WHAT YOU HAVE</span></div>\n    <section id=\"start\" class=\"wrap section\">\n      <div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">01 · YOUR STARTING POINT</p><h2>What matters to you today?</h2></div><p>Choose one focus. Change it whenever you like.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"goal-grid\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Your main focus\">\n        <button class=\"goal active\" data-sfg-goal=\"basics\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"goal-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">◎</span><strong>Eat a bit better</strong><span>Start with what you already eat.</span></button>\n        <button class=\"goal\" data-sfg-goal=\"smaller\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"goal-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↘</span><strong>Eating less</strong><span>Make smaller meals count.</span></button>\n        <button class=\"goal\" data-sfg-goal=\"budget\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"goal-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">£</span><strong>Keep costs down</strong><span>Work with the cupboard.</span></button>\n        <button class=\"goal\" data-sfg-goal=\"quick\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"goal-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">◷</span><strong>Short on time</strong><span>Keep the cooking simple.</span></button>\n        <button class=\"goal\" data-sfg-goal=\"protein\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"goal-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span><strong>Plan protein foods</strong><span>Give them a place in your meals.</span></button>\n        <button class=\"goal\" data-sfg-goal=\"plants\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"goal-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✳</span><strong>More variety</strong><span>Try a few more plant foods.</span></button>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"context-details\"><summary>A little context <span>Optional · a few taps</span></summary><div class=\"context-grid\"><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"diet\">How do you usually eat?</label><select id=\"diet\"><option value=\"mixed\">A mix of foods</option><option value=\"vegetarian\">Vegetarian</option><option value=\"vegan\">Vegan</option></select></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"appetite\">How is your appetite?</label><select id=\"appetite\"><option value=\"usual\">About usual</option><option value=\"smaller\">Smaller / eating less</option><option value=\"glp1\">Smaller while using a GLP-1</option></select></div></div></details>\n      <p class=\"privacy-note\">Your choices stay in this tab. Nothing is sent to SHIFT or saved to My Timber. Refresh starts afresh.</p>\n      <div id=\"starting-result\" class=\"starting-result\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"></div>\n    </section>\n    <section id=\"food\" class=\"food-section\"><div class=\"wrap section\">\n      <div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">02 · MAKE FOOD WORK FOR YOU</p><h2>A useful meal.<br>No spreadsheet required.</h2></div><p>Pick an idea, swap an ingredient and make it work for you. Amounts are cooking starting points, not personal targets.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"meal-tabs\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Meal\"><button data-sfg-meal=\"breakfast\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Breakfast</button><button data-sfg-meal=\"lunch\" class=\"active\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Lunch</button><button data-sfg-meal=\"dinner\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Dinner</button></div>\n      <div class=\"food-grid\"><div class=\"food-builder\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">PICK YOUR MEAL</p><div id=\"recipe-choices\" class=\"recipe-choices\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Meal ideas\"></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"protein-swap\">Choose the version you fancy</label><select id=\"protein-swap\"></select></div><p class=\"small\">Kitchen times are rough estimates. They vary with your equipment and ingredients.</p><p class=\"small\">Check pack labels for allergens and cooking instructions. Follow any personal dietary advice.</p></div><article class=\"meal-output\" aria-labelledby=\"meal-title\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">YOUR MEAL IDEA · <span id=\"meal-time\"></span></p><h3 id=\"meal-title\"></h3><p id=\"meal-description\"></p><div id=\"meal-tags\" class=\"tag-row\"></div><div class=\"recipe-columns\"><div><h4>What you’ll use · one meal</h4><ul id=\"ingredients\"></ul></div><div><h4>How to make it</h4><ol id=\"method\"></ol></div></div><div class=\"food-tip\" id=\"meal-tip\"></div><div class=\"meal-actions\"><button id=\"use-meal\" class=\"button primary\">Make this my next step →</button><button id=\"save-meal\" class=\"button secondary\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Keep this idea +</button></div><p id=\"meal-status\" class=\"small\" role=\"status\"></p></article></div>\n      <div class=\"food-notes\"><article><span class=\"note-no\">01</span><h3>Variety beats perfection.</h3><p>Include different food groups over the day. Fresh, frozen and tinned fruit and veg can all contribute. Fortified dairy alternatives can be useful; check the label.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://www.nhs.uk/live-well/eat-well/how-to-eat-a-balanced-diet/eating-a-balanced-diet/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NHS balanced diet ↗</a></article><article><span class=\"note-no\">02</span><h3>Give fibre some attention.</h3><p>Oats, wholegrains, beans, fruit and veg can contribute fibre. Try variety across meals rather than relying on one food.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://www.nhs.uk/live-well/eat-well/digestive-health/how-to-get-more-fibre-into-your-diet/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NHS fibre guide ↗</a></article><article><span class=\"note-no\">03</span><h3>Eating less? Keep eating well.</h3><p>If a GLP-1 reduces your appetite, keep meals regular and include protein. If eating becomes difficult, you feel unwell or have troublesome side effects, contact your prescriber promptly.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://www.bda.uk.com/food-health/glp-1-obesity-medications.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">BDA eating well with GLP-1s ↗</a></article></div>\n    </div></section>\n    <section id=\"shopping\" class=\"wrap section\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">03 · CHECK THE CUPBOARD FIRST</p><h2>A small shopping list.</h2></div><p>Keep up to three ideas. Tick what you already have. Repeated ingredients are grouped, with amounts shown by meal.</p></div><div class=\"shopping-grid\"><div><h3 class=\"small-heading\">Your kept ideas</h3><div id=\"saved-meals\"></div><p id=\"shopping-scope\" class=\"small\"></p><button id=\"clear-saved\" class=\"text-button\" hidden>Clear kept ideas</button></div><div class=\"shopping-card\"><div id=\"shopping-list\"></div><p id=\"shopping-count\" class=\"small\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p></div></div></section>\n    <section id=\"next\" class=\"next-section\"><div class=\"wrap section\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">04 · YOUR NEXT SHIFT</p><h2>One useful step.<br>Enough for today.</h2></div><p>Choose something you can do. You can change your mind.</p></div><div class=\"next-grid\"><div><fieldset id=\"action-options\"><legend>Choose your next step</legend><label class=\"action-choice\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"action\" value=\"meal\" checked><span>Make one meal.<small>Use your chosen idea this week.</small></span></label><label class=\"action-choice\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"action\" value=\"cupboard\"><span>Check what I have.<small>Build the shopping list around the cupboard.</small></span></label><label class=\"action-choice\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"action\" value=\"swap\"><span>Try one small swap.<small>Add a protein food, wholegrain or fruit and veg.</small></span></label><label class=\"action-choice\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"action\" value=\"advice\"><span>Ask for individual advice.<small>Use your own care team when food is becoming difficult.</small></span></label></fieldset><div class=\"field when-field\"><label for=\"when\">When might you try it?</label><select id=\"when\"><option value=\"This week\">This week</option><option value=\"Tomorrow\">Tomorrow</option><option value=\"At my next food shop\">At my next food shop</option><option value=\"When it fits my week\">When it fits my week</option></select></div></div><aside class=\"plan-card\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">YOUR TAKEAWAY</p><h3 id=\"plan-title\"></h3><p id=\"plan-body\"></p><p class=\"plan-safety\">Meal ideas are general adult information, not a complete daily diet or a personal nutrition plan. Adjust to your appetite and needs. Keep following your own clinical or dietary advice.</p><div class=\"plan-actions\"><button id=\"download\" class=\"button primary\">Download my takeaway ↓</button><button id=\"print\" class=\"button secondary\">Print / save as PDF</button></div><p id=\"download-status\" class=\"small\" role=\"status\"></p><p class=\"small\">Nothing is sent to SHIFT or saved to My Timber. The download stays on your device.</p></aside></div><div class=\"follow-through\"><strong>Take it into your week.</strong><p>Use your takeaway as a prompt for your next food check-in in My Timber. Your takeaway is not saved automatically to your account.</p></div></div></section>\n    <section id=\"evidence\" class=\"wrap section evidence-section\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">THE BASIS, MADE READABLE</p><h2>Useful ideas. Clear limits.</h2><div class=\"evidence-grid\"><div><h3>Food you can work with.</h3><p>These are original SHIFT meal ideas built around general food-group guidance. They aren’t personalised prescriptions. We haven’t calculated calories or nutrient totals, promised weight loss or tested these recipes in a kitchen trial.</p><details><summary>When to get individual advice</summary><p>If you have a health condition, have had bariatric surgery or need a special diet, speak to your GP or a registered dietitian about what suits you. Persistent low appetite, unexplained weight loss or difficulty eating need assessment.</p><p>If you use a GLP-1 and feel unwell or have troublesome symptoms, contact your prescriber. Keep following any prescribed plan.</p></details></div><div><h3>Sources you can inspect.</h3><p>General guidance checked on <strong>12 October 2026</strong>. Recipe times and amounts are SHIFT estimates; they aren’t values supplied by these sources.</p><details><summary>Open the source register</summary><div id=\"sources\"></div></details></div></div></section>\n  <div class=\"guide-controls\"><button id=\"reset\" class=\"text-button\">Reset my choices</button></div></main><div class=\"guide-announcer\" id=\"announcer\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>";
